ff09\n\u30fb\u304e\u3087\u304e\u3087\u304e\u3087\uff01VR\u6de1\u6c34\u9b5a\u7435\u7436\u6e56\u535a\u7269\u9928\uff08\u8349\u6d25\u5e02\uff09"}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "216090312932766", "locale": "en_GB", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Shiga VR", "keywords": ["travel", "Kyoto", "Firework", "Japan", "Asia"], "long_description": "If Kyoto is on your travel bucket list, don\u2019t forget to add \u201cShiga\u201d!  Shiga prefecture, located just a few minutes away from Kyoto, is a perfect place to enjoy Japanese traditional sceneries and many more, while avoiding crowds.\nThis app is ultimate travel guide of Shiga!\n\nWhat\u2019s in \u201cShiga VR\u201d?\nYou can find 6 different spheres on the map once you put on the headset. Each sphere is the gateway for a unique experience through Shiga.\nAll you need is to just grab the sphere you want to experience and throw it!\n\n6 unique experiences:\nTo celebrate autumn leaves\n\u30fbKeisoku-ji Temple, Nagahama\nTo enjoy summer in Shiga\n\u30fbNorth Lake Biwa Firework Festival, Nagahama\nTo experience the change of seasons\n\u30fbSakamoto Cable Railway, Otsu\n\u30fbAvenue of Metasequoias\nFly above Lake Biwa as a \u201cBirdman\u201d\n\u30fbJapan Birdman Rally VR, Hikone\nSwim through Lake Biwa as a freshwater fish\n\u30fbLake Biwa Museum, Kusatsu", "short_description": "If Kyoto is on your travel bucket list, don't forget to add its neighbor \"Shiga\u201d!\n\u201cShiga VR\u201d is a travel app to guide you to 6 different locations of Shiga in a unique manner.\n\nThe 6 different locations are:\n\u30fbKeisoku-ji Temple, Nagahama\n\u30fbNorth Lake Biwa Firework Festival, Nagahama\n\u30fbSakamoto Cable Railway, Otsu\n\u30fbAvenue of Metasequoias\n\u30fbJapan Birdman Rally VR, Hikone\n\u30fbLake Biwa Museum, Kusatsu"}]}, "developer_name": "ytv VR", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.ytv.co.jp/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_